			"notes": "Added missing recipes from 1.0.0\nAdded Stained Bricks in all 16 colours\nFinished Concrete variants\nChanged name of Nether Quartz variants (e.g. Rose Nether Quartz Ore changed to Nether Rose Quartz Ore)\nAdded Dripstone variants\nAdded Indigo Quartz and variants (subject to change, give me feedback!)\nAdded Indigo Quartz Ore and Item\nAdded Indigo Quartz Ore generation to The End\nAdded Citrine and variants (unobtainable currently, no texture)\nAdded Citrine Ore and Item (unobtainable currently, no texture for item)\nAdded Quartz Tiles to all variants (including new ones from this release)\nAdded natural Calcite generation in blobs slightly smaller than vanilla igneous rocks\nRevamped Marble generation, only generating in Calcite deposits, or rarely in large Marble deposits\nAdded unique Marble and Calcite generation to mountain biomes\nFrom now on all blocks added will have complete recipes, including this version\n\nPictures from this release:\n\nStained Bricks and Concrete Variants:\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"2026-08-21_13 07 51\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/39c655c7-836b-427e-920e-24b6fee91518\" />\n\nDripstone Variants:\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"2026-08-21_13 11 42\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af0d8256-8314-4123-9563-c7103f2b460f\" />\n\nIndigo Quartz and Variants:\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"2026-08-21_13 29 27\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4529899b-e726-4730-85e1-e654ec9b13dd\" />\n\nSome of the Quartz Tiles and Variants:\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"2026-08-21_13 29 00\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b3041ba-f492-4757-b3bf-8d79ca8749d3\" />"
